+ * order is fine. One prefill chunk has n_tokens*6 (token, expert) pairs with
+ * heavy duplication -- the 90 pairs of 15 tokens usually land on a few dozen
+ * distinct experts. Moving them verbatim would transfer the same expert a dozen
+ * times over, burning PCIe for nothing.
