+ * spent 131-164 ms per layer on gateup, i.e. 1.8 GB/s, while decode moves the
+ * same bytes through gather at 14.5 GB/s. **The 8x difference is not bandwidth
+ * but access pattern** -- strided scattered reads of quantization blocks versus
+ * a contiguous DMA. */
